<title>USA: Info Resource Engineering names CFO.</title>
<headline>Info Resource Engineering names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Information Resource Engineering Inc said Monday that it has named Richard Tennant chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Tennant was previously CFO of Netrix Corp.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said that Tennant fills a newly created position.</p>
</text>
